OL,3,GNEWSANext step for UK roll-out of
OL,4,Awomen's safety group
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder of a volunteer patrol group
OL,7,Fwhch helps women and girls stay safe at
OL,8,Fnight says a step has been made towards
OL,9,Frolling it out nationally.
OL,11,FNight Angels was set up in Stroud,
OL,12,FGloucestershire, by resident Chrissie
OL,13,FLowery in 2023 after her experiences as
OL,14,Fa domestic abuse survivor, and has
OL,15,Fsince expanded into other parts of the
OL,16,Fcounty and Wiltshire.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
