OL,3,GNEWSANext step for UK roll-out of
OL,4,Awomen's safety group
OL,5,
OL,6,FLowery went to Westminster to meet Alex
OL,7,FDavies-Jones, the government minister
OL,8,Fresponsible for reducing violence
OL,9,Fagainst women and girls, on 21 October
OL,10,Fto talk about an expansion further
OL,11,Fafield.
OL,13,FShe told BBC Radio Gloucestershire: "It
OL,14,Fwas incredible, a really good meeting.
OL,15,FShe's on board to help us to expand."
